<div class="text-center py-5">
  <h1 class="display-5 fw-bold"><%= ENV.fetch("APP_NAME", "Givesplit Demo") %></h1>
  <p class="lead text-muted mt-2"><%= ENV.fetch("APP_TAGLINE", "") %></p>
  <p class="text-muted mx-auto mt-3" style="max-width: 640px;">
    A vague &ldquo;$4,000 garden&rdquo; is a project nobody can say yes to. Write the need the way you would say
    it to a neighbour and tick the kinds of giving your community uses. The split turns it into eight to fourteen
    named Parts, money, materials, tool loans, hours and skills, with at least half of them costing nothing but
    time, a tool or a skill. Money never moves through this app.
  </p>
  <div class="mt-4 d-flex justify-content-center gap-3">
    <% if signed_in? %>
      <%= link_to "Go to my needs", needs_path, class: "btn btn-primary btn-lg" %>
    <% else %>
      <%= link_to "Try it free", sign_up_path, class: "btn btn-primary btn-lg" %>
      <%= link_to "Sign in", sign_in_path, class: "btn btn-outline-secondary btn-lg" %>
    <% end %>
  </div>
</div>

<hr class="my-5 opacity-25">

<div class="mx-auto" style="max-width: 960px;">
  <h2 class="h5 text-muted text-center mb-4">Example &mdash; a fictional neighbourhood association&rsquo;s need</h2>

  <div class="card mb-3">
    <div class="card-body">
      <p class="text-muted small mb-1">The need</p>
      <p class="mb-0 fst-italic">
        &ldquo;We want to turn the empty lot behind the Ashgrove Street laundromat into a community garden with
        raised beds. Someone priced it at about $4,000 but nobody knows what that covers.&rdquo;
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="card mb-3">
    <div class="card-body">
      <h3 class="h5 mb-1">Ashgrove Street community garden</h3>
      <p class="numbers-sentence mb-0">$1,500 in money across 4 Parts (3 with an amount), and 8 asks for time, tools, skills and materials.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="row g-3 mb-3">
    <% [
         ["tool_loan", "A rototiller for one weekend", "1 weekend"],
         ["materials", "Twelve cubic yards of garden soil, delivered", "12 cubic yards"],
         ["money", "About $900 for cedar lumber for six raised beds", "About $900, a guess to check"],
         ["hours", "Saturday build, 8 hours, four people", "32 hours"],
         ["skill", "Someone who has built raised beds to draw a simple plan", "2 hours"],
         ["hours", "Watering rota, 30 minutes a day for the first month", "15 hours"]
       ].each do |kind, name, size| %>
      <div class="col-sm-6 col-lg-4">
        <div class="card h-100 part-tile <%= kind == 'money' ? 'part-tile-money' : 'part-tile-non-money' %>">
          <div class="card-body">
            <span class="badge kind-badge <%= kind == 'money' ? 'kind-badge-money' : 'kind-badge-non-money' %> mb-2"><%= Need::KIND_LABELS[kind] %></span>
            <h3 class="h6 mb-1"><%= name %></h3>
            <p class="small mb-0 <%= kind == 'money' ? 'text-warning-emphasis' : 'text-body-secondary' %>"><%= size %></p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    <% end %>
  </div>
  <p class="text-center text-muted small mb-0">&hellip;and six more: a second Saturday, a truck for a morning, seedlings, hoses, a tool box, and a share of the water bill.</p>

  <p class="text-center text-muted small mt-4">
    AI-generated. A first draft of the Parts for you to edit; amounts marked as a guess need checking.
  </p>
</div>

<div class="text-center mt-5 pb-4">
  <% unless signed_in? %>
    <%= link_to "Split your own need &rarr;".html_safe, sign_up_path, class: "btn btn-primary" %>
  <% end %>
  <div class="mt-3 text-muted small">
    Open source &middot;
    <a href="https://givesplit.com" class="text-muted">Givesplit</a>
  </div>
</div>
